      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1212474531,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 219550627,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787280015558,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "File events may continue\nto come through",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "File events may continue\nto come through",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RnxnHocZtJjmOxZVXjmka",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 775.5302470814097,
      "y": 566.7423400878904,
      "width": 451.023681640625,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 778684131,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 1467677357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787280116889,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Once {gracePeriod} seconds pass with no new file events,\nand after finishing the last SVG generation,\nwe'll consider the Python side complete.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Once {gracePeriod} seconds pass with no new file events,\nand after finishing the last SVG generation,\nwe'll consider the Python side complete.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uYCCStn2n4Wi1hn0GaWKl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 614.5594237428727,
      "y": 16.32582014738884,
      "width": 1119.859130859375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2057734056,
      "version": 395,
      "versionNonce": 335984552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787367983716,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. \"exit\" arrives, causes cs_done_event.set().\n2. We begin calls to grace_timer(...), that each may be cancelled whenever new file(s) arrive, if any.\n3. If cs_done_event.is_set(), and upon begininng and completion of new SVGs, CANCEL grace_timer and restart it.\n4. Eventually, 1 grace_timer will complete, and cause python_done_event.set().",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. \"exit\" arrives, causes cs_done_event.set().\n2. We begin calls to grace_timer(...), that each may be cancelled whenever new file(s) arrive, if any.\n3. If cs_done_event.is_set(), and upon begininng and completion of new SVGs, CANCEL grace_timer and restart it.\n4. Eventually, 1 grace_timer will complete, and cause python_done_event.set().",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
